  {
    "insert": "\nAcademic papers are written as continuous text to facilitate a coherent, comprehensible flow of argumentation and to ensure the clear presentation of complex content. Since your text consists of many individual paragraphs and bullet points, it is more difficult to follow it. Read your text carefully again and delete unnecessary paragraphs. Instead, try to find transitions and leave out the bullet points."
  },
