    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "The motivation should explain to the reader why the chosen topic is relevant and which weakness the thesis wants to address. In your text the problem and its relevance are only mentioned, but not described in detail. It would be important to explain in more detail why the topic is important, what general problem is being addressed and what the significance of solving this problem is. You could use examples for this."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "The methodology describes how the individual research questions will be answered. Your methodology already has a good structure, but it should be more detailed. Consider more carefully how you plan to answer your research questions. For example, you should also address the software mentioned more clearly. It can also be helpful to address each research question individually in the methodology."
